  "details": "EDIT: Forgot to add that I'm using the most recent update, which is build 1093. \nIt started when I entered an avatar world. I wanted to favourite an avatar from there and unfavourite some other avatars from different worlds, but when I clicked the favourite button, nothing happened.\nWhen I clicked unfavourite button, the number of avatars went down, but the avatar was still there. \nI closed and opened the menu back up to see if that would help, the avatar I unfavourited was still there, while the one I wanted to favourite wasn't and the avatar number went back up. Attempted to unfavourite again, but this time it didn't react at all. \nI also tried to go back home, but the issue still prevailed and even after opening and closing VRChat.",
